Title: 雪の手紙
Author: ComicForge demo
Reading: rtl

INT. ATTIC ROOM - NIGHT

Wind rattles the lattice. Snow piles on the windowsill.

YUKI kneels in front of an old wooden chest. Dust motes hang in the lamp light.

YUKI
（独白）
姐姐留下的箱子……五年了。

She lifts the lid. A bundle of letters tied with red string.

YUKI
为什么……从来没有寄出？

EXT. SNOWY COURTYARD - CONTINUOUS

A figure in a black coat stands beneath the plum tree, watching the attic window.

The figure's breath fogs the air. They smile.

STRANGER
找到了。

INT. ATTIC ROOM - MOMENTS LATER

Yuki unfolds the topmost letter. Her own name, in her sister's handwriting.

YUKI
（颤声）
给我的……？

A floorboard creaks behind her. She freezes.

YUKI
谁——？!
